1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:03,200
First rule, you get 12 hours.

2
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:06,140
Second, follow my lead and change nothing.

3
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:07,320
Just stick to the script.

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:08,720
Third.

5
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,960
I know, past and future.

6
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:12,940
Must remain untouched.

7
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:14,220
Let's discuss the mission.

8
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,260
You're to grab financial data from Treda Games

9
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:20,300
before their third quarter report is released the day after tomorrow.

10
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:23,640
A female corpse was found in the river last night.

11
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:27,520
According to the police, the deceased was employed in the financial department...

12
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:30,420
You're all trash and need to be slaughtered.

13
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,860
You'll pay, I promise.

14
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:36,620
I'll kill every last one of you!

15
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:38,520
Hey, Chanbin!

16
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:41,160
The page about the seventh victim isn't in the file.

17
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,660
I thought I'd killed her.

18
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:45,780
Then, I heard someone else screaming.

19
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:48,640
Liu Min couldn't have killed that woman.

20
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:50,220
We have the proof.

21
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:51,520
It'd be impossible.

22
00:00:51,520 --> 00:01:00,260
Last night at 1.30, somebody broke into Zhu Shanxan's place,

23
00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:01,440
and then he attacked her.

24
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:08,040
Tomorrow at this time, find the real me.

25
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:09,700
Figure out his M.O.

26
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:12,020
Give him some hints as to who we are,

27
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:13,940
and make him play by our rules.

28
00:01:13,940 --> 00:01:19,680
I'll see you very soon.

29
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,960
And when that time comes,

30
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:23,940
don't you dare cheat again.

31
00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:27,140
If I did change something,

32
00:01:27,460 --> 00:01:28,920
how many lives would be affected?

33
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:33,320
So it's true.

34
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:35,620
There was a witness after all.

35
00:01:36,480 --> 00:01:37,120
Interesting.

36
00:01:37,580 --> 00:01:38,540
What did you just say?

37
00:01:40,420 --> 00:01:40,940
What if...

38
00:01:40,940 --> 00:01:41,940
If...

39
00:01:41,940 --> 00:01:43,060
You mean was...

40
00:01:43,060 --> 00:01:45,560
You're another one of his friends, eh?

41
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:49,180
You...

42
00:01:49,180 --> 00:01:51,660
Can possess people, too?

43
00:01:59,100 --> 00:02:00,100
Liu Kuan.

44
00:02:02,240 --> 00:02:03,180
I'm sorry.

45
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:06,260
Everything is going to be different now.

46
00:02:06,260 --> 00:02:06,800
Shaolin!

47
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:11,600
Death isn't something any one of us can change.

48
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:15,680
Liu Kuan!

49
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:19,420
The best we can do...

50
00:02:19,420 --> 00:02:20,980
is accepted.

51
00:02:21,980 --> 00:02:22,960
So please,

52
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:26,120
don't let this be another burden for you to carry.

53
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,120
Liu Kuan!

